  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, the theorist learns to overcome common pitfalls in their reasoning. Whenever the theorist would take any penalties on skill checks attempted against the target of their theory, the total penalty is reduced by the theorist’s theory bonus (to a minimum of 0).</p>\n<p>At 9th level, this penalty negation also applies to AC and CMD against the target of their theory.</p>\n<p>At 13th level, it also applies to attack rolls against the target of their theory.</p>\n<p>At 17th level, it also applies to saving throws against abilities used by the target of their theory. This ability does not reduce or negate self-imposed penalties, such as those from charging or using feats such as Power Attack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/theorist#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
